---
import Photo from './Photo.astro';
---
<section class="section safety" id="safety" aria-labelledby="safety-title" data-folio="VI · Safety &amp; certification">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="chapter-head grid">
      <p class="chapter-mark" data-reveal>
        <span class="chapter-mark__no">VI</span>
        <span class="chapter-mark__rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="chapter-mark__label">Safety &amp; certification</span>
        <span class="chapter-mark__of" aria-hidden="true">VI / VII</span>
      </p>
      <h2 class="chapter-title" id="safety-title" data-reveal="up">Safety first. <em>Then the lift.</em></h2>
    </header>

    <div class="safety__spread grid">
      <figure class="plate safety__fig" data-reveal>
        <div class="plate__frame">
          <Photo name="rigging-team" sizes="(min-width: 960px) 56vw, 92vw" w={1280} h={813} alt="Three FHS crew in red coveralls in front of a Terex FRIENDSHIP crane" />
        </div>
        <figcaption class="plate__cap"><span>Three FHS crew in red coveralls, in front of a Terex FRIENDSHIP crane.</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div class="safety__text" data-reveal="stagger">
        <figure class="plate safety__inset">
          <div class="plate__frame">
            <Photo name="superlift-uae-flag" sizes="(min-width: 960px) 30vw, 92vw" w={1280} h={1707} alt="Heavy crane with superlift counterweight beside a tower draped with the UAE flag" />
          </div>
          <figcaption class="plate__cap"><span>Lifting beside the flag, in the Emirates since 1986.</span></figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p>Every lift starts with a plan. Our quality and occupational health &amp; safety management systems are certified to ISO 9001:2015 and ISO 45001:2018, and we hold UAE In-Country Value (ICV) certification.</p>
        <p>Trained operators and lifting supervisors are provided with our equipment, and our site surveys come with engineered rigging studies for maximum safety and efficiency.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <ul class="certs" data-reveal="stagger">
      <li class="cert">
        <p class="cert__std">ISO 9001:2015</p>
        <p class="cert__name">Quality management</p>
        <dl class="cert__facts">
          <div><dt>Certificate</dt><dd>SD-26048/01</dd></div>
          <div><dt>First certified</dt><dd><time datetime="2017-03-26">26 Mar 2017</time></dd></div>
          <div><dt>Valid to</dt><dd><time datetime="2027-03-25">25 Mar 2027</time></dd></div>
        </dl>
        <p class="cert__scope">Scope: General Transportation and Renting of Mobile Cranes &amp; Lifting Equipment.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="cert">
        <p class="cert__std">ISO 45001:2018</p>
        <p class="cert__name">Occupational health &amp; safety</p>
        <dl class="cert__facts">
          <div><dt>Valid to</dt><dd><time datetime="2028-11-30">30 Nov 2028</time></dd></div>
        </dl>
      </li>
      <li class="cert">
        <p class="cert__std">ICV</p>
        <p class="cert__name">UAE In-Country Value programme</p>
        <dl class="cert__facts">
          <div><dt>Certificate</dt><dd>150476</dd></div>
          <div><dt>ICV score</dt><dd class="cert__score">47.14%</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Valid to</dt><dd><time datetime="2026-11-03">03 Nov 2026</time></dd></div>
        </dl>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
